id: ops-release-inventory-gaps
title: Resolve release inventory gaps before the remaining fleet migration
description: "The refreshed read-only inventory includes pm-memory. Before the remaining fleet migration, confirm pm-observer repository and release policy, supply missing package notes scripts, preserve approval and manual-only guards, and validate package-specific tests and bundle hooks. Evidence: docs/release-migration.md. The core pm-cli repository remains excluded."
